IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `gewca-possession`

-- Guns, Explosives and Weapons Control Act 2021, ss 3, 4, 5(3), 11, 17, 22, 27, 29, 34, 36, 38, 39, 74, 85, First to Third Schedules -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_guns-explosives-and-weapons-control-act-2021.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

